FUNCTION displayDashboard():

    Display total number of learners

    Display completed and outstanding tasks

    Calculate and display learner progress

    Display upcoming assessments

    Display upcoming support sessions

    Display recent submissions

    Display notifications


FUNCTION calculateProgress():

    FOR EACH learner:

        Calculate:
            completed tasks / total tasks × 100

        IF progress >= 70:
            Status = "On Track"

        ELSE IF progress >= 50:
            Status = "At Risk"

        ELSE:
            Status = "Needs Attention"

    Display learner progress


FUNCTION addTask():

    Get task title
    Get due date
    Get assigned learner

    IF required information is missing:

        Display error message

    ELSE:

        Add task to tasks list
        Refresh dashboard


FUNCTION uploadAssessment():

    Get assessment title
    Get assessment type
    Get due date

    IF required information is missing:

        Display error message

    ELSE:

        Add assessment to assessments list
        Refresh dashboard


FUNCTION bookSupportSession():

    Get learner
    Get date
    Get time
    Get topic

    IF required information is missing:

        Display error message

    ELSE:

        Add session to support sessions list
        Refresh dashboard


WHEN page loads:

    displayDashboard()

END

